3|0@elderscrollsonline^1439611582#cu3lmds:furbz420$:Whoever said sorcs are weak is crazy. Sorcs are THE strongest PvP class, hands down. Sorcs can do it all, a ton of burst damage, self healing, huge wards, tons of mobility. They are tanky as hell in light armor, I would honestly consider them OP, and I really don't throw that word around. Check out sypher's website, he's got some great sorc builds, I'd recommend the burst one (3200 spell damage.) It's also essentially the same build as KingRichard's Stars and Stripes Build. I'm running it right now and it's incredible. I was previously using my stam Nightblade, which put out a lot of damage, but the sorc puts out just a little less with incredible survivability. 
